Paths: skills/mesh/prism/SKILL.md (ported as prism)

Modifications: rewritten rather than copied, with our section order, no
em-dashes and no references to unported sibling skills. Kept rules: lenses, not
roles, one per distinct failure mode with 2 to 5 and no default count; one
load-bearing reason per lens; verdicts grouped as agree, agree for different
reasons or disagree; the output is the one question that resolves the
disagreement; never average; do not manufacture disagreement; lenses are drawn
fresh per artifact; user-invoked only. Lenses run inline by default. Added
"Not for" lines naming the-fool and macrothink.
